msgid "Android in-app purchases"
msgstr "Android 應用程式內購"

msgid ""
"Godot provides the first-party `GodotGooglePlayBilling <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-google-play-billing>`_ Android plugin for integrating the "
"`Google Play Billing library <https://developer.android.com/google/play/"
"billing>`_, enabling applications distributed through Google Play to offer "
"one-time purchases and subscriptions."
msgstr ""
"Godot 提供了原生的 `GodotGooglePlayBilling <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot-google-play-billing>`_ Android 外掛，用於集成通過 Google Play 發佈的 "
"`Google Play Billing library <https://developer.android.com/google/play/"
"billing>`_，支援應用程式，從而支援一次性購買和訂閱模式。"

msgid ""
"For installation, setup instructions, and the API reference, see the "
"`GodotGooglePlayBilling documentation <https://godot-sdk-"
"integrations.github.io/godot-google-play-billing/>`_."
msgstr ""
"如需瞭解安裝、設定說明及 API 參考資訊，請參閱 `GodotGooglePlayBilling "
"documentation <https://godot-sdk-integrations.github.io/godot-google-play-"
"billing/>`_. 。"
